  description: "(This card is always treated as an \"Armored Xyz\" card.)\r\nAn Xyz
    Monster equipped with this card gains these effects.\r\n\u25CF Cannot be destroyed
    by battle.\r\n\u25CF Once per turn, if this card battled this turn (Quick Effect):
    You can return 1 card equipped to this card to the hand, then immediately after
    this effect resolves, Xyz Summon 1 WATER Xyz Monster.\r\nOnce per turn, during
    the End Phase, if this card is in the GY because it was sent there this turn:
    You can equip this card to 1 Xyz Monster you control. You can only activate 1
    \"Reincarnation Unveiling Mail\" per turn."
